We are building the AtomQuest Goal Tracking Portal. Tech Stack: React (Vite, TS, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Recharts) and FastAPI (Python, Motor for async MongoDB Atlas). Roles: Employee, Manager, Admin. Strict Rules: Use modern, enterprise SaaS aesthetics with colored status badges (Draft, Submitted, Returned, Approved, Locked). Always write modular code. Never mock data in production routes; always read/write to MongoDB. Enforce strict type checking.
Always follow business logic defined in:
- docs/BRD.md
- docs/VALIDATION_RULES.md
- docs/ROLE_PERMISSIONS.md
- docs/WORKFLOWS.md
- docs/CHECKIN_RULES.md
- docs/SHARED_GOALS.md
- docs/REPORTING_REQUIREMENTS.md

Never violate BRD requirements.
Always enforce validation rules on both frontend and backend.
Always preserve workflow state consistency.